window.products.push({"id":754015,"name":"RAFFAELLESCO DELUXE: Soup/Pasta Coupe Bowl [RA02CP] - Authentic hand painted in Deruta, Italy. Original design. Shipped from the USA with Certificate ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LzJCjyBoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RAFFAELLESCO: The classic Raffaellesco pattern of Italian majolica, is a design that has stood the test of time and is among the most popular and enduring patterns of all. Its origins date back to the 16th century, inspired by Raphael's graceful arabesques in his famous frescoes. Featuring a stylized dragon in the central motif, Raffaellesco is said to have been painted by Raphael himself, a master painter and architect of the Italian High Renaissance. The dragon symbolizes the benevolent deity who bestows good luck and fair winds to seagoing merchants, making it an ideal pattern for anyone looking for a touch of good fortune. Our Raffaellesco Deluxe pattern offers authentic, top-of-the-line quality products that are created using the original designs and patterns. It is a perfect way to bring a piece of Italian cultural heritage and artistic traditions into your home. ABOUT ARTISTICA - DERUTA OF ITALY PRODUCTS: WE GUARANTEE AUTHENTICITY: Ordering from us ensures that you'll receive genuine, first-quality products. Our products are 100% original, brand new, and masterfully hand made in Italy. Each is always accompanied by a Certificate of Authenticity and further authenticated with a tamper evident Hologram Sticker! Our tabletop ceramic ware, is sourced from Deruta, a small hilltop town in the central Italian region of Umbria, while the finest handcrafted luxury Home Decor pottery come from Tuscany, Sicily, and the Amalfi Coast. We ship from the USA and our company Artistica - Deruta of Italy, and we were the first direct importer in the United States of real Deruta pottery since 1983.  Use and Care: We ensure that all Deruta of Italy products are 100% lead and cadmium-free, and they are dishwasher safe. However, we do recommend use in microwaves only for short reheating purposes (30 seconds or so) as earthenware products may get very hot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LzJCjyBoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAFFAELLESCO DELUXE","source_asin":"B00OI1JONG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OI1JONG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OI1JONG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
