window.products.push({"id":754093,"name":"Cinque Terre Manarola Italy Cliff Homes Landscape Photo Photograph Art Sicily Almafi Coast Picture Beautiful Scenery Cool Wall Decor Art Print Poster ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PzCKcUCCL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Poster measures 36x24 inches (92x61 cm) and ideal size for any standard 36x24 frame. Lightweight and low-glare satin finish paper creates photo quality poster art for your home decor. All poster prints are carefully rolled and packed. MAKES A GREAT GIFT - Whether you need a special gift for friends or family or looking for yourself, our wall poster is suitable for living room decor, bedroom wall art, bathroom decor and office posters wall decoration. This cool wall art will light up your home, it is the modern way to brighten up any space, each and every piece comes with its own unique story. We believe in delivering impeccable quality prints that last a lifetime. MADE IN THE USA and OFFICIALLY LICENSED - This poster is professionally printed in the USA on premium acid-free paper for a high color aesthetic and years of fade resistant enjoyment of your artwork. The attractive images come from our vast curated collection of officially licensed and custom designed art prints. EASY TO HANG - Wall decor posters are easy to hang in a variety of ways. Our posters ship professionally rolled in a sturdy tube and you can use tape or putty or pins or poster hangers or poster frames to hang them on your wall. You can also laminate them to create door signs or a dry erase sign for your bulletin board. ITALIAN DECOR ITALY POSTERS - Mediterranean wall art and Mediterranean Pictures and Italy Travel Posters are the perfect way to create an Italy Wall Decor Europe theme. An Ancient Rome Colosseum Poster or Picture of Positano Cinque Terra map of Tuscany or Venice to Southern Italy. These make the perfect gift for a friend Dad Mom Son or Daughter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PzCKcUCCL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poster Foundry","source_asin":"B0C55TCZZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C55TCZZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C55TCZZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754094,"name":"Sandicast Christmas Ornament, Sandstone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610mVpbLbGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the Holiday season arrives, don't forget that pets love the festivities just as much as we do! Sandicast's charming collection of Christmas ornaments features over 40 different breeds of man's best friend enjoying the holiday spirit in a variety of ways: some sport bright red Santa hats or are cozily wrapped in winter scarves, others are decked out in strings of lights or carrying Christmas stockings. Several breeds are also available in multiple expressions and poses (sitting, standing, lying, sitting pretty or crouching), each one \"decorated\" for holidays in a different way. Sandicast Christmas ornaments have a securely attached metallic cord loop for hanging and are packaged in a protective reusable box that's perfect for year-round storage. But don't feel compelled to put that special ornament away just because the holidays are over . we won't tell! Sandicast was founded in 1981 when artist Sandra Brue realized her dream of combining her artistic talent and her lifelong love of animals. Because of the superb quality of her work, collectors around the world now pursue the demand for Sandicast animal sculptures. Queen Elizabeth and President Clinton are just a few of the many celebrities that have Sandicast animals. Sandra has sculpted more than 400 animals; the Sandicast Collection includes everything from dogs and cats to exotic wildlife. Each piece is hand-cast and hand-painted and virtually comes to life when sparkling glass eyes are inserted. Sandicast invites you to discover their extensive collection of hand sculpted animals available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610mVpbLbGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandicast","source_asin":"B014KMEL80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014KMEL80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014KMEL80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
