window.products.push({"id":754142,"name":"Elit Sense Lavender & Chamomile Reed Diffuser Refill Oil, 8 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kkCKB6nOL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Reed Diffuser has proven to be the most effective way to add scents to our living space; it is a safe, flame-free home fragrance solution with bright, vibrant scents. Simply place reed sticks and pour scented oil into diffuser bottle. Turn reeds over once to expose oil-moistened diffuser reeds to the air. The oil will continue to wick up the diffuser reeds, scenting your room for several months. To intensify fragrance, invert reeds once a week. For best result, replace reed sticks once a month. When the oil is finally used-up, simply pour in an oil refill and replace the reed sticks. Absolutely no heat is needed to enjoy aromatic diffuser reeds. Add the element of aromatherapy to your personal space, and enjoy your favorite fragrance without the risk of fire. You'll never wonder whether you blew out the candle! Our Reed Diffusers use only the highest quality oil made in the USA. The oil is 100% alcohol free, and it comes from natural extracts. Our Reed Diffusers are safe for the environment, human, and pets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kkCKB6nOL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elit Sense","source_asin":"B00B94WV6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B94WV6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B94WV6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754143,"name":"ZOOCRAFT Hand Blown Glass Orange Crab Figurine Handcrafted Miniatures Collectible Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wQV-nLDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crab is another fascinating sea creature that has significant symbolical and spiritual importance to humans. This strange looking animal has been inspiration to people since ancient times to modern day.  Crab symbolism is reminding you that not all paths lead directly to your personal goals. In other words, sometimes a sideways approach is necessary. Therefore, you must shift your focus to what is all around you because your inner senses are trying to guide you through an easier way. From the Manufacturer We love blown glass because of the pure imagination poured into every piece created. Our art glass pieces come from our own ideas and designs. Our artists use an open flame torch to melt down glass rods and then delicately shape the molten glass. Once the sculpt is finished, our professional artists carefully paint each glass figurine, detailing every nook and cranny.  The sculptures look like live animals, and we think they are different from others you might see. we enjoy the process of creating our own ideas and developing them into original works of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wQV-nLDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOOCRAFT","source_asin":"B08D3D414C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D3D414C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D3D414C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
