window.products.push({"id":754277,"name":"Malicosmile Small Dream Catchers for Cars Rear View Mirror, Handmade Car Charm Pendant Gray Feather and Turquoise Dream Catcher for Car Wall Bedroom H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pS1f81pIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Dream catcher was originated from the 18th century. Indians used it to capture the beautiful dreams and let the nightmares vanish with the appearance of the morning sunshine. They believed that the nights were filled with various dreams and the dream catcher can filter the bad ones and bring them into sweet ones. 1. Product Information: ♥ Product Name: Gray feather with turquoise small dream catchers ♥ Material: Metal fittings + Natural feathers + ABS beads + thread + turquoise ; ♥ Size: About 11.8 inch (30 cm) in total length, 2.7 inch (7 cm) in circle diameter; ♥ Color: Gray. 2. Product Features: ♥ The small dream catcher is handmade. Each one is unique in the world; ♥ The dreamcatcher adds elements of turquoise embellishment. The style of the feather pendant is modern and exquisite; ♥ The dream catchers feathers are fumigated and then carefully screened to ensure that each feather is flawless and trimmed by the master; ♥ Because of its beautiful design and symbols, the dream catcher is a great gift idea. The dream catcher will make the space alive and bring more happy; 3. Product Application: ♥ The dream catcher is perfect for car rearview mirror decorations, the perfect size will not affect the driver's sight; ♥ The dreamcatcher is prefect for wall to decorate your house, bedroom or anywhere you want; ♥ It is a great festival holiday and birthday gift for your friends or families, with best wishes to them. 4. Note: 1. The dream catchers are pure handmade, so it is normal if there are little differences between each one.2.Avoid long-term exposure to the sun 5. Service: If there is any question, please feel free to contact us. We will do our best for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pS1f81pIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Malicosmile","source_asin":"B08BWW3XS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BWW3XS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BWW3XS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
