window.products.push({"id":754280,"name":"FunDecorArt Canvas Wall Art for Bedroom Bathroom Living Room, Orange Truck Load of Fall Pumpkin Modern Giclee Picture Artwork, Oil Painting Decor Stre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jp8tCxReS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This solid wood wall-mounted canvas print is fashionable, fascinating, and suitable for any modern, contemporary or vintage decorative indoor wall art. About Product Material- Waterproof & UV Resistant Canvas Frame- Wooden High Definition Giclee Painting- Pixel Picture Print on Canvas, As Clear As A Poster Complete Size- Available in 6 Sizes Package- 1 Panel 4 Sizes: 8 x 8 inche, 12 x 12 inche, 16 x 16 inche, 20 x 20 inche, 24 x 24 inche, 28 x 28 inche. Everything is Ready- Canvas is Stretched & Framed on frame, Hook is Wooden Inner Frame. What you need to do is just hanging artwork on the wall. No painting needed. Hang the Painting. ? It's appropriate to hang single artwork at eye level. The best distant from painting center to the floor is 60 inches. If you're hanging art above furniture, it can be 4-6 inches above these furniture. If the art is going above a sofa or console, the wall decor art should be approximately 2/3 width of the sofa/console. The first step you need to do is measuring and mark a spot on the wall. Step 2 is hammering the white nails onto the wall. Step 3 is hanging the picture. Warmth Reminder1. This wall decoration is not hand-painted, but giclee printed on canvas, so the color may be slightly different due to different monitors.2. We do our best to provide you with a beautiful artwork. If the product is damaged in the delivery process, please email us let us know, we will reply you within 24 hours to refund or resent a new product for you.3. Before you place an order to buy, please measure the wall where you want to hang the painting and ensure to choose the correct size. The webpage pictures are for reference only, because they are not taken in a real showroom, nor do they represent the real size of the scene.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jp8tCxReS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunDecorArt","source_asin":"B098WQMT88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098WQMT88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098WQMT88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
