window.products.push({"id":754384,"name":"KIATA 【𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟐 𝐍𝐞𝐰】 Electric Lunch Box 2 in 1 Portable Food Heater for Car Truck Home and Work, Food-Grade Removable 304 Stainless Steel Portable Food Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VVWXEmW7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟐 𝐢𝐧 𝟏 & 𝐇𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘁𝗵𝐲 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗪𝗮𝗿𝐦 𝗠𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘀 𝗼𝐧 𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗚𝗼】Our Electric Lunch Box, contains two different plugs: one for students and commuters to enjoy hot meals (110V), and one for car/truck drivers to have healthy home-cooked meals on the go (12V). 【𝗙𝗮𝘀𝘁 𝗣𝗧𝗖 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗧𝗲𝗰𝗵𝗻𝗼𝗹𝗼𝗴𝘆】Once plugged in, the Portable Food Warmer heater starts to heat your meals. Using PTC’s original thermostatic can keep your home-cooked meals warm long enough. Food Heater Electric Box uses the dual function of more safety and heat insulation. 【𝗥𝗲𝗺𝗼𝘃𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗘𝗮𝘀𝘆 𝘁𝗼 𝗖𝗹𝗲𝗮𝗻】The removable electric lunch box includes removable stainless steel containers and plastic boxes for fruits or vegetables that you can take out individually and are very easy to clean. They are also dishwasher safe. 【𝗙𝗼𝗼𝗱 𝗚𝗿𝗮𝗱𝗲 𝗠𝗮𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗮𝗹 & 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗦𝗽𝗼𝗼𝗻 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗙𝗼𝗿𝗸 】Food-Grade electric lunch box insulated lunch box is made of PP and 304 stainless steel, which is non-toxic, healthy, and safe. It also comes with a spoon and fork, and a separate compartment to hold them. 【𝗟𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲 𝗖𝗮𝗽𝗮𝗰𝗶𝘁𝘆 &𝗟𝗲𝗮𝗸-𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗼𝗳 𝗗𝗲𝘀𝗶𝗴𝗻】The leak-proof electric lunch box have a large capacity to meet your dietary needs. The electric lunch box also includes a removable plastic compartment to avoid stringing together different types of food. Plus, are you still worried about food/water leakage from your electric lunch box? The Lunch Heater Microwave features an upgraded design and craftsmanship with a rubber seal and latches on the lid to make it completely leak-proof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VVWXEmW7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIATA","source_asin":"B09XHM7FQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XHM7FQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XHM7FQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
