window.products.push({"id":754439,"name":"Hompus Mini Trash Can with Lid Soft Close, 0.8 Gallon/3 Liter Round Small Garbage Can, Removable Inner Waste Basket, Step Pedal Trash Bin for Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519Y12F+9sL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compact & Elegant Black Trash Can: The round shape and modern style make this small garbage can work in so many places throughout your home. The elegant round trash can is the perfect size for narrow living spaces, bathrooms, bedrooms, offices, apartments, dorm rooms, kid rooms and other small spaces. The trash is contained and out of view and kept in a garbage can with lid. Soft Close Lid & Complement Any Home or Office Decor: The lid opening and closing is smooth. There's absolutely no noise because as the lid shuts it does so ever so gently. The classic round profile shape makes this garbage can be a contemporary addition to any home or office. Stop Trash Odors: The trash can with lid does a great job at keeping the yucky smell contained. It covers up the smell of trash for a fresh and clean smelling home and healthier air. It is strong enough to keep odor in and strong enough to keep your pesky, curious animals out. Removable Inner Wastebasket: Having the ability to remove the inner can/liner is so convenient for cleaning and changing out trash! The handle is solid and easily accessible which means all you have to do is grab and pull straight up to remove the inner can. There is a convenient handle on the back of the waste basket to move it easily. Anti-Fingerprint & Anti-Rust: This small garbage can boasts sturdy stainless steel construction for daily use. The smooth black finish is fingerprint-resistant, rust-resistant to keep the appearance shinny. It provides this luxurious, elegant look which really adds to just about any and every decor. Built to Last: Durable, ergonomic stainless steel pedal requires minimal force to open, it is designed to last over 200,000 steps – that’s more than 20 steps a day for over 20 years! The step design means you can operate it hands-free. No Risk to Purchase: If this wastebasket with lid you received is dented, damaged or the wrong color item, please contact us by Amazon email for a timely resolution, we are willing to send you a new garbage bin replacement or a full refund. Hompus provides 1 year warranty, 30 days money back and reliable customer service support within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519Y12F+9sL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hompus","source_asin":"B0BB7MDMS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7MDMS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7MDMS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
