window.products.push({"id":754448,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer & Best MOM Ever Mug Set, Electric Cup Warmer for Desk Office Home, Beverage Warmer with 2 Temperature Setting, 8-Hours Auto Shut Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fyEiT7b9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【Adjustable 2-Temperature Setting】: Smart coffee warmer has 2 TEMP settings fit your warming needs. You can control the temperature by tapping the button, keeping your coffee or milk up to 104℉-122℉/40℃-50℃ or 122℉-140℉/50℃-60℃.. Keep your beverage at a perfect drinking temperature. ❤【8-Hour Auto Shut-Off】: This Electric Beverage Warmer will shut off automatically if it works 8 hours continuously. No worry about forgetting to turn it off. There is no safety hazard. 1.5M/59IN charge cord makes it perfect for office desk, home,kitchen, dorm and more. ❤【Compatible with Most Cups】: The heating plate adopts sealed-insulation technology to prevent splashing water, 3.7 inch heating plate is also fits for other glass cup, stainless steel cup, porcelain cup, also for can also be used as your candle warmer for candle wax. NOT suitable for plastic cups and double insulation mugs. ❤【Fast-Heating Ceramic Mug】: 14oz(400ML) capacity can meet your daily needs and lid to cover the mug will also help retain heat. This ceramic mug is designed with special frosted cup bottom for fast heating, no more wait, just enjoy your hot coffee at any time. ❤【Best Gift Choice】: A cute present for any mom,the mug has been carefully printed with ''Best MOM Ever'' is on both sides, great gifts to give your mom on Mothers Day, Birthday, Thanksgiving Day and Christmas and so on. Cup Warmer with mug set comes in a novel and cute packaging. Let this mug warmer warm her stomach and heart!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fyEiT7b9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOUTYTUO","source_asin":"B0BRX9TMTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRX9TMTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRX9TMTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
