window.products.push({"id":754478,"name":"Stanley Trigger Action Travel Mug 0.35L / 12OZ Matte Black – Keeps Hot for 5 Hours - BPA-free Stainless Steel Thermos Travel Mug for Hot Drinks - Leak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wngO6QzfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Stanley brand has a rich 100+ year history. Born from inventor William Stanley Jr. who forever changed the way hot drinks were consumed, in 1913 he fused vacuum insulation and the strength of steel in one portable bottle, inventing the all-steel vacuum bottle we know and love today. In the century since, his vacuum bottle evolved from concept to icon and has become an essential part of workdays, road trips and outdoor adventures. The Stanley brand has been part of countless adventures and even more shared memories. Stanley has powered daily coffee breaks and just as many meals in their beloved food and beverage gear. With each passing year Stanley continues to push themselves to bring timeless, yet modern, solutions to today's outdoor adventure. For Stanley it's about ramping up your time outdoors with gear you can count on from dusk to dawn, from coffee to kick start the day to spirits to cap off the evening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wngO6QzfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stanley","source_asin":"B0825N3DWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0825N3DWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0825N3DWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754479,"name":"Dalstrong Saute Pan - 12 inch - The Oberon Series - 3-Ply Aluminum Core Cooking Pan - Premium Silver Kitchen Cookware - 5 QT - Omelet, Beef, Egg Pan -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FwcrlfbqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dalstrong Oberon Series 12” Stainless Steel sauté pan is a deep, versatile pan, ideal for sautéing, poaching, braising, and deep frying. Stir ingredients with ease, they won’t escape the high sides of this pan. Use this for layered recipes or for building sauces or other deep dish recipes. 3-PLY ALUMINUM CORE & 18/10 STAINLESS STEEL CLADDING — for optimized heat conductivity, control, and responsiveness. Excel at searing, with cookware that gets hot fast. Layers of smudge-free aluminum & 18/10 stainless steel above and below the Aluminum Forged Foundation provide maximum durability and easy maintenance. These layers protect the incredible temperature control and speed of the copper core with durability and longevity. TRUE HEAVY GAUGE — Ultra strong 2.5mm thickness that will never dent or warp under prolonged heat, for consistent cooking results every time. Oberon cookware sets include true heavy gauge pots, pans, and lids. Heavy gauge cookware is strong, durable, and cooks foods evenly. The bottom stays perfectly flat for even heat distribution. MESS-FREE POURING — The flared lip creates the perfect drip-free pour, for easier dishing up and serving of sauces and stir fries. Savor every drop of sauce or broth from stir fries, soups, and any other dishes poured from Dalstrong cookware. The skillets, pans, and pots all have a flared lip for a clean pour that lands where you want it. ERGONOMIC HANDLES — All of the handles in Oberon pots, pans, and skillets, are made to be ergonomic. Designed to accommodate a professional chef's underhand grip, the perfectly angled handles ensure a comfortable and secure hold while cooking. Never drop or spill a dish again, thanks to handles that are easy to grip even while wearing oven mitts. Easily maneuver these pots and pans from stovetop to oven or table. Engraved side handles add control, maneuverability, and prestige. INDESTRUCTIBLE VENTED LID — Strong, stainless steel lids will last a lifetime and maintain a perfect seal. The vented hole releases pressure to prevent rattling and food from boiling over. Each piece of Oberon cookware features a perfect fit lid. Enjoy the perfect omelet, frittata, rice, or sauce with the heat-retaining, moisture-preserving effect of a perfect fit lid. COMPATIBLE AND INCORRUPTIBLE — The Dalstrong Oberon series is compatible with all stovetops, as well as oven and broiler safe up to 800 degrees F (500 degrees for the nonstick line). Brave the elements: freezer, dishwasher, and refrigerator safe. Oberon pots and pans can be used over an open flame, propane stove, induction stovetop, and more. Oberon cookware is made from non-toxic, hypoallergenic materials that are PFOA and PTFE free, and the stainless steel surface is ultra-durable. LIFETIME WARRANTY against defects. Rocksolid 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk free. Comes with renowned Dalstrong customer service and nearly 100,000 5-star reviews. Over one million orders have been fulfilled so far. See why chefs around the world trust and love, 'The Dalstrong Difference'.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FwcrlfbqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B09SJ3Q7KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SJ3Q7KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SJ3Q7KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
