window.products.push({"id":754494,"name":"World Map of Cities by Michael Tompsett, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BPg2a0-ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a world map of cities in text. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BPg2a0-ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYLJ9A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYLJ9A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYLJ9A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754495,"name":"Silicone Gummy Bears Candy Molds Chocolate Molds 50 Cavities with Bonus Droppe 3 Pack，Best Gifts for Children's Day (Blue, Green, Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FKzw4NVrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HoShip Silicone Gummy Bear Chocolate Molds 50 Cavities 150 Bears with 3 Droppers There are 50 bears on each mold, totally 150 bears on 3 trays. The size of each tray are 7.5\" x 5.5\" x 0.5\" / 19cm * 14cm * 1.3cm. Also come with a dropper for filling the molds easier and more convenient.  Dropper Size: 4.7\" / 12cm. No Worry About Break Using hard plastic molds, sometimes the mold cracks when you try to get your pieces out. But this silicone mold won't crack or break like that. You could take them out effortlessly. Easy to Fill & Easy to Clean With the little dropper, the molds can be easily filled with whatever you like. Also the flexible silicone makes it easy to be cleaned. Safe to use in dishwasher and freezer. Broadly Use: They are great for making gumdrop, candy or chocolate for the children. Or they can be used to make some candies on cake, pudding, wax, ice cubes and any other things that you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FKzw4NVrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoShip","source_asin":"B06Y4432H8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y4432H8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y4432H8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754496,"name":"Choice Parts Recliner Cable with Release Handle - Exposed Cable Length 5\" – Total Cable 36.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mqSzr5k7L._AC_.jpg","description":"This D Pull style handle has the D shaped handle 2 by 2.5. From the top of the handle to the top of the 2 hole attachment plate is 2.5 inches. The 2 hole mounting plate, at the top of the D Pull, is 1” long and 1.75” wide (SCREWS NOT INCLUDED). The exposed wire is 5” with an S shape tip. The cable from the black collar below the handle to the end of the S tip is 36.5 inches.. The entire assembly is 40.5” from top of handle to end of tip. This cable handle is a pull type or sometimes called a parachute or \"D\" handle. This is used on reclining furniture that has the handle in between the seat and the arm (you reach down beside the seat cushion and pull this up). The critical measurement for D pull assemblies is the exposed wire and the cable length from the mounting plate to the exposed wire. The cable can be as long or longer than your current cable and works equally well with or without a spring on the exposed wire. The excess cable will just hide inside your sofa. But the exposed wire length, clip style and ending tip is critical. For any DIY project, measurements and fittings are very important. The exposed wire and ending shape are critical for the proper operation of the footrest mechanism of your reclining furniture. Please remove the broken or damaged handle and save any screws or attachment pieces. Carefully observe the attachment of the exposed wire to the footrest release mechanism and the position of the mounting clip when removing the handle. There are several lengths of cables and exposed wires as well as mounting plate, clip, and ending shapes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mqSzr5k7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Choice Parts","source_asin":"B017OK4XEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017OK4XEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017OK4XEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
