window.products.push({"id":754537,"name":"Westclox 14” Office with Digital Calendar & Temperature, Silver Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RwIhsi0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Westclox 14” office wall clock has a beautifully clean design. The large black numbers and white face make it easy to read the time. The LCD digital display shows Month, Date & Day of the Week. It also features indoor temperature (Fahrenheit or Celsius). Sleek design blends in perfectly with most decors. Complete with glass lens for the final touch. Quality quartz movement ensures perfect time accuracy. Requires two AA batteries to operate. Proudly made by Westclox, Trusted by Americans since 1884.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RwIhsi0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westclox","source_asin":"B08SY69YQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SY69YQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SY69YQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754538,"name":"BEAUHAK Vinyl Tablecloth Rectangle, 54'' x 108'' Waterproof Spill Proof Oil Proof Stain Proof PVC Table Cloth, Wipe Clean Plastic Table Cover for Indo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KZO68BIkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL: BEAUHAK floral tablecloth is made from high quality environmentally PVC, the material allows wrinkled tablecloths to be quickly restored to flatness. Its good drapability, excellent strength and durability not only extend the life of outdoor table cloth, but also protect your table from scratches. Active dying technology, is used to effectively prevent fading and warping, and it looks like new when you use every time. The soft smooth surface can bring good comfort to your meal. RECOMMEND SIZE: The picnic table cover available in 2 sizes: 54 x 78 inch, 54 x 108 inch. Please measure your table size before buying. (Pls note the tablecloth size ≠ table size). The flower patterns and textures of the tablecloths are matched together to create a comfortable dining environment for you and your family in a simple but elegant way. FEATURE: Our holiday table cloths have good waterproof, spill-proof, oil-proof, scratch-proof, stain resistant and dust-proof functions. All liquids will form beads on its surface, which effectively prevents liquids from infiltrating the table and protects the table from being wet and soiled. It is a good protective cover, which can better protect the table, prevent dents and scratches, extend the life of the table. Also won’t be easily removed, so you can enjoy your dinner with no worries. MULTIPLE PURPOSES: The wipeable tablecloth is perfect for many occasions, such as kitchen, living room, dining room, restaurant, indoor, outdoor, party, wedding, banquet, picnic, camping, barbecue, is a unique and exquisite gift for birthday, Christmas, Valentine’s Day and Thanksgiving more. You can also cut it into various sizes for DTY and decorate your cabinets, coffee tables and bedside tables. EASY CARE: Compared with traditional tablecloths, the heat resistant table covers are easier to clean and take care of. Just use a damp cloth, napkin, or sponge, don’t worry the water, oil, wine, coffee, beverage, juice falls on the tablecloth. Pls note: DO NOT MACHINE WASH, DO NOT BLEACH, DO NOT IRON, DO NOT USE THE DRYER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KZO68BIkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEAUHAK","source_asin":"B09327QR9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09327QR9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09327QR9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
