window.products.push({"id":754576,"name":"Popcorn Popper, Hot Air Popcorn Popper 1200W No Oil Popcorn Maker with Measuring Cup and Removable Top Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D4d63wSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy freshly popped popcorn with the Fresh Pop Popcorn Maker. Healthier than using the stovetop or microwave oven, the high-capacity heating chamber requires no oil and uses only hot air. Includes a butter melting tray. -Make fresh, warm popcorn in your own home in just minutes -Perfect for creating that unique party snack or simply enjoying a relaxed movie night -No oil required -Popper’s high-capacity heating chamber produces cups of delicious popcorn using only hot air -Includes a butter melting tray for preparing delicious buttery flavor without artificial flavoring or preservatives -Non-slip base -Stay-Cool Housing: With silkscreen logo -On/Off Switch: Easy one-touch operation -Popping Chute: Removable for dishwasher cleanup -1200 watts of power leaves no kernel unpopped -Plastic/metal -Wipe clean popper -Popping chute and butter tray are dishwasher safe for easy cleanup -4-cup capacity -24-month limited manufacturer's warranty Product Specification: Color: White, Black Power: 1200W Weight: 1.2 kg Plug Type: US Plug Voltage: 110V Frequency: 60Hz Material: Metal, Plastic, Stainless Steel Product Size: 6.3 x 7.1 x 11.8 inch Package Content: 1 x Popcorn Maker, 1 x User Instruction Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D4d63wSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homdox","source_asin":"B082NSDB9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082NSDB9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082NSDB9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754577,"name":"Rock Your Chakra Calymene Trilobite Fossil 2\" 3-5 Oz B Grade Morocco Rocks Minerals Root Chakra Healing Crystals and Stones","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ktG6Kr6HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description NOTE: PLEASE do not purchase this item and then leave us a bad review. These are B GRADE specimens. They have many different imperfections. The head area not well formed, broken edges, the body ridges not well formed, etc. We are selling them at cost instead of throwing them away. These Calymene Trilobites are imported by Rock Your Chakra from Alnif, Morocco.  You will receive one fossil from the lot shown in the listing photos that is 2 inch to 2 1/2 inch and weighs 3 to 5 ounces. Healing Properties Fossils are a wonderful tool to assist you in moving from the old to the new and to be receptive to the fresh, innovative forces that are available to you. Fossils can assist you in your quest for transition, transformation and personal growth, helping you to understand the process of change. They can help you instil quality and excellence in your environment. The trilobite can promote both leadership and management skills, allowing one to rule lovingly and with patience and fortitude. It assists in the development of patience, strength, and perseverance, allowing one to recognize the desired course and to maintain the pathway which will produce the desired goal. It is an example for humanity that one may be in charge of the world, and still, virtually, be required to \"sit in the mud\". Mineral Description Trilobites, meaning \"three lobes\", are a fossil group of extinct marine arachnomorph arthropods that form the class Trilobita. Trilobites form one of the earliest known groups of arthropods. The first appearance of trilobites in the fossil record defines the base of the Atdabanian stage of the Early Cambrian period (521 million years ago)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ktG6Kr6HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rock Your Chakra","source_asin":"B082ZRGZCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082ZRGZCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082ZRGZCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
