window.products.push({"id":754686,"name":"KissAir Reusable Brushed 18/8 Stainless Steel Round 9 Inch Plates Dish Set Vintage Eco Friendly Metal 304 Heavy Duty Kitchenware Feeding Dinner Dishes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fi0av5S7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HEAVY DUTY DINNERWARE(^ᴗ^) - made of top quality 18/8 Stainless Steel you can use them practically anywhere, indoors or outdoors for camping, picnicking or to serve your favorite guest. These plates are also rust resistant, strong and are really easy to clean after using them for food STURDY AND DURABLE (^ᴗ^) - Sturdy enough and don't worry about it bending, Matte polished is not easy to leave fingerprints and spotting, Stackable and saves room in your cabinets CHEMICAL AND TOXIN FREE, ENVIRONMENT FRIENDLY(^ᴗ^) - BPA Free ,Plastics, Lead, Paint Free and Toxins Free. Our pure 304 stainless steel is superior to chemical plastic, breakable glass/ ceramic or flimsy metal bowls that dent when they hit the floor. PERFECT SIZE (^ᴗ^) - Proper size to fit child's hand, Healthy dinner dishes, Also works well as a serving plate for fruit, cookies, nuts, The dishes can be heated in the oven, Great as small oven trays PORTABLE MESH BAGGING(^ᴗ^) - Comes with a mesh bag, so that when you are done with using your plates, you can just store them away easily in the bag, and use it to carry your plates around wherever you need to take them","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fi0av5S7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KissAir","source_asin":"B0817X1QFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0817X1QFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0817X1QFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":754687,"name":"Nixie Clock by Nixie Dream IN-14 Nixie Tubes Vintage Retro Desk Fully Assembled and Tested Comes in Premium Gift Packaging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mY3R4iHsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Nixie Clock is fully assembled and tested with IN-14 nixie tubes from Soviet era. The nixie clock runs on electricity and backed up with lithium battery inside in case of power outages. EU/US plug and universal adapter for worldwide use is included. The tubes are showing time, date, alarm time. The tubes back lighted underneath with a Royal Blue LED gorgeous floor lightings, RGB light, candle like effect and animation effects when changing the numbers. Attractive Royal Blue tube floor lighting - RGB floor lighting - Candle effect Attractive Royal Blue tube floor lighting - RGB floor lighting - Candle effect Built in ambient light sensor. As the ambient light increases, so does the tube brightness. This allows you to preserver tube life by running the tubes at a lower current (brightness) during the evening and nights automatically. Built in ambient light sensor. As the ambient light increases, so does the tube brightness. This allows you to preserver tube life by running the tubes at a lower current (brightness) during the evening and nights automatically. 12/24 hour format - Lithium battery backup. Keeps time for months during any power outages 12/24 hour format - Lithium battery backup. Keeps time for months during any power outages Ultra accurate clock chip, crystal controlled. Accurate time for years to come. Ultra accurate clock chip, crystal controlled. Accurate time for years to come. Alarm Clock - Programmable effect when display the date. Alarm Clock - Programmable effect when display the date. Smooth cross fade between digits, smooth fade between digits, shuffle effect, slot machine effect Smooth cross fade between digits, smooth fade between digits, shuffle effect, slot machine effect Worldwide 110/220V power adaptor Worldwide 110/220V power adaptor Easy user menu controlled by simple 2-button operations Easy user menu controlled by simple 2-button operations IR remote control. IR remote control. We carefully finish the casing with four coats of Danish oil and sand in between to give the final product a natural smooth feel. After all the case is polished with Carnauba wax to produce a smooth high gloss surface.  Dimensions: W x H x D (with tubes): 185 x 80 x 60 mm (7.3\" x 3.5\" x 2.3\")","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mY3R4iHsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nixiedream","source_asin":"B00N7YLSW0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N7YLSW0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N7YLSW0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
