window.products.push({"id":754746,"name":"DUJUST 1st-Class Bone-china White Salad Plate Set of 6 (8in), Luxury Design with Handcrafted Golden Trim, Top Grade Porcelain Kitchen Plate Set/for Sa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618kFkn8HGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 Golden Trims Showcase a Luxury Design】This beautiful plate set is designed with handcrafted golden trims, which are made of German Heraeus gold glaze. They are a shiny white on the bright side, simple and elegant. This beautiful plate set can also be a decoration for your table and home. With this elegant plate in hand, you will surely feel much happier when you are dinning with your family or friends. 【1st-Class Bone-china, Chip-Resistant & Durable】All the pieces of this set are made of 1st-class bone-china. Bone-china is the Top Fine Porcelain, which is much more translucent, lightweight, durable, and easy to clean. It is Lead-free, BPA-free and chip-resistant. This set has a beautiful look, a translucent glazed color, and a smooth texture. We carefully select the materials, so you can feel the daintiness when you touch the smooth edge and see the light passing through the plate. 【Perfect Gift Idea & Amazing Set for Friends】This elegant set makes the perfect gift for any gift-giving occasion. The decent design also makes a great home decor, you will surely enjoy having guests with this set on your table, and enjoy the delicious food and happy moment together. Comes in an intact package, which is safe and clean. 【Care Instruction】The product is NOT Microwave Safe. The gold trim of the product is made of German Heraeus gold glaze, and the REAL gold inside the glaze may cause an electric arc in the microwave oven, which may lead to damage. It is dishwasher safe only in neutral PH, at low temperatures. We do recommend washing it by hand with a soft cloth. For long-term use, please also pay attention to avoid sharp objects scratching the trim. 【90 Days Money Back with 2 Years Warranty】DUJUST is committed to providing our customers with high-quality exquisite plate sets. And we ensure your satisfaction. If you have any questions about the product, please contact us, we are always keeping active to solve your problem. For each customer shopping with DUJUST, we provide you with 90 days money back service and 2 years warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618kFkn8HGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUJUST","source_asin":"B094ZV8VBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094ZV8VBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094ZV8VBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
