window.products.push({"id":754805,"name":"Anniversary Personalized Picture Frame 5x7 Photo 1st 5th 10th 15th 20th 25th 30th 35th 40th 45th 50th J Devlin Pic 319 EP549 (5x7 vertical)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SK7-SuZyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Beautiful in any setting, this photo frame features clear glass trimmed with a beaded edge that dresses up the clean and simple design. Triangular glass sides add stability and style unique to J Devlin frames. Ascetically pleasing from all angles and your photos are easily inserted into the back. This glass picture frame will compliment any home décor from mid-century modern to traditional. Make this the ideal anniversary gift by adding your own favorite photo and personalizing with names and dates for a couple celebrating their life together. Use our suggested layout or be creative. Whatever year you are celebrating a 1st or 50th or any time between this frame can be personalized to commemorate that special day. Lettering will appear in a white frost on the clear glass.This picture frame is available in a range of sizes. This handcrafted stained glass picture frame has been made with lead free solder to protect you and the environment. The metal trim and solder have also been stained with an antique charcoal patina and a wax applied to the picture frame keeping it beautiful for years to come. Polish with a soft dry cloth if necessary. Each picture frame is carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans using a copper foil and solder technique developed by Louis Comfort Tiffany in the late 1800’s. This age-old art form combined with 21st century designs creates the perfect combination for unique home décor. J Devlin has been designing and manufacturing quality glass home decor since 1999. Please enjoy this exclusive and original design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SK7-SuZyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Devlin Glass Art","source_asin":"B085WFH984","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085WFH984","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085WFH984","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
