window.products.push({"id":754936,"name":"VIWIK Kitchen Cooking Frying Wooden Chopsticks 16 1/2 Inches Chopsticks Extra Long Set of 2 Pairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qS8heCDLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE - Length: 42cm/16.5 in, weight: 95g/0.2 lb, Material - Swartizia spp. Wood. DESIGN - Selecting the natural timber for manual polishing, comfortable handle. The chopsticks are mellow, full and smooth, difficult to deform, burr-free and gentle to hands. Wax-free and Lacquer-free, Easy to clean. The wood chopsticks ensure the health of body. SAFETY - In some cooking links, the chopsticks are good tools. Ordinary chopsticks are so short that the hands might be scalded by boiled oil when we fry the food or produced high-temperature steam when we steam the food. So you need a longer pair of chopsticks for cooking. Please try our VIWIK Extended Chopsticks for you. It is able to fry, deep-fry, pick-up and instead-boil at ease. With the VIWIK Extended, you will never be worried about burned hands. PROTECT - Perfect for deep frying, cooking noodles and other cooking with splashing oil and steam. Use this long chopstick to protect your hands from hurt. MAINTENANCE - When using chopsticks for the first time, it’s recommended to soak them in cold water or warm saline for about 10 minutes, then brush a layer of food oil on the surface of the chopsticks and wait for them to dry before using. The log chopsticks have no paint on the surface, so when the first soak, the color of the log will seep a little, which is normal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qS8heCDLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIWIK","source_asin":"B08B5FBQXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5FBQXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5FBQXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
