window.products.push({"id":754948,"name":"Laura Ashley 5x7 White Floral Textured Hand-Crafted Resin Picture Frame with Easel, for Tabletop & Wall Display, Decorative Floral Design Home Décor, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D6+J3dhnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Laura Ashley baroque style, hand-crafted resin frame is the perfect way to preserve your favorite photos and moments. Its classic design features a rose-like flower detail that surrounds the outer edge of the frame, while the thin inner border is dotted with smaller flowers for an elegant look. To add to its sophistication it has a beautiful black velvet backing that will ensure the safe-keeping of your pictures. With this frame, you can easily display your 2x3, 4x6 and 5x7 photos on the wall or on any tabletop surface. Whether you are reflecting on a favorite memory, or showcasing a stunning art print, this vintage-inspired picture frame will display your favorite photographs wonderfully in both landscape and portrait mode. This solid baroque style frame is designed with striking detail. Inspired by Victorian-era elegance, there is a timeless allure to this lightweight, modern frame. But don’t be fooled by its delicate flowers, this high-quality frame is sturdy and will keep your beloved memories safe and secure. Whether you display it on a mantlepiece or accent cabinet, or rest it on a desktop, the frame can be displayed vertically or horizontally. Hang multiple frames on a wall and the classic and contemporary appearance can turn a blank wall into a home art gallery. Love is meant to be shared, and this vintage-looking photo frame is the perfect way to do so. It also makes a wonderful gift to loved ones and friends, so they too can cherish all of life’s most precious and celebratory moments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D6+J3dhnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B0BK2VD3V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-754948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK2VD3V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK2VD3V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
